5. 该技术可推广至其他需要重叠memory/preprocessing/computation的GPU kernel设计

COMET-W4Ax的SIMT-enhanced software pipeline在此基础上增加了对mixed-precision GEMM的支持：
```
// COMET SIMT-enhanced pipeline (two shared memory buffers: buffer0, buffer1)
// Iteration 0: buffer0 holds A0/W0, buffer1 prefetches A1/W1
//   buffer0 (tensor core): load A0/W0 via ldmatrix → mma (INT4 or INT8)
//   buffer1 (CUDA core + async copy): cp.async load A1/W1 from HBM
//                                     → permute A1 (if needed, via CUDA cores)
//                                     → dequant W1 (if needed, via CUDA cores)
//   async_copy_barrier()  // ensure buffer1 data is fully loaded
//   __syncthreads()       // all threads sync before buffer switch
// Iteration 1: swap — buffer1 feeds tensor core, buffer0 prefetches
```
COMET的关键差异：(1) 数据加载后可能需要permutation（activation channel reordering）和dequantization（INT4→INT8 format conversion），这些由CUDA cores处理——CUDA cores吞吐（78 TFLOPS）远低于tensor cores（1248 TOPS），若不pipeline将成严重瓶颈；(2) 不同类型tile（W4A4 vs W4A8）触发不同的data transformation path，pipeline需自适应。Ablation显示无pipeline时COMET-W4Ax性能退化1.69×。与ZipGEMM的decompression pipeline、Quantix的dequantization-matmul pipeline相比，COMET额外引入了permutation和mixed-precision dispatch，三类pipeline共同验证了hierarchical software pipeline在GPU kernel中隐藏preprocessing latency的通用性。

涉及论文标题：
- ZipServ: Fast and Memory-Efficient LLM Inference with Hardware-Aware Lossless Compression
- High-Throughput Non-Uniformly Quantized 3-bit LLM Inference
- RoMeo: Mitigating Dual-dimensional Outliers with Rotated Mixed Precision Quantization
- COMET: Towards Practical W4A4KV4 LLMs Serving

